2.2 Instalación de quarto en codespaces github
Puedes usar Quarto en GitHub Codespaces de manera excelente, ya que ofrece un entorno preconfigurado basado en VS Code que elimina la instalación local.
@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ wget https://github.com/quarto-dev/quarto-cli/releases/download/v1.5.57/quarto-1.5.57-linux-amd64.deb

@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ sudo dpkg -i quarto-1.5.57-linux-amd64.deb

@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ quarto check

@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ quarto render

@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ quarto publish gh-pages
Para guardar los cambios en GitHub:
@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ git add .
@yachasun40 ➜ /workspaces/power-systems-notes (main) $ git commit -m "update content"

